  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-164-xiaolun-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">魏<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-164-xiaolun-death:p001:m0001" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAA">楊忠</persName>圍汝南，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-164-xiaolun-death:p001:m0007" ref="i6h_2do_eob">李素</persName>戰死。二月，乙亥，城陷，執<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-164-xiaolun-death:p001:m0022" ref="81y_7i5_frc">邵陵攜王綸</persName>，殺之，投屍江岸；<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-164-xiaolun-death:p001:m0036" ref="0va_s3x_wb4_B">岳陽王察</persName>取而葬之。</p>
</text>
